; Burrow — the record binary codec + zero-copy field reader. Pure OCaml (only depends on the in-memory
; Bson value type), so it is unit/property-testable with no disk. [Bson.t] <-> compact record bytes;
; [find_field] walks to one field while skipping the rest by size (the read-path win the spike showed).
(library
